        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo thwol am'oyido obedo ogwaŋ mariek swa kwoŋ ogwaŋe madudi je ma Were oyido ocweyo. Openjo dhako ni, “Were bende adieri owaco ni wikiri wicam olemo ma yen ma ndelo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.1"
            ]
          }
