          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka dhako odwoko ni, “Wanyalo camo olemo ma yath moro je i ndelo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwanyo woko yath manitie i dier ndelo. Were owaco ni wakiri wacam olemo ma yath no kosa kada geyo; ka wanotim, wabino tho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
