          "text": "Kenyo Rwoth Were owaco ni, “Neni, jacwo onyo olokere acel kwoŋ wan, m'oŋeyo bero gi raco. Go nyalo camo wok kwoŋ yath ma kwo to kwo cil gi cil.” ",
